Third-party data shipped with this project:

  world.json  Country outlines derived from Natural Earth (public domain),
              via the world-atlas package (ISC licence, Mike Bostock).
  gaz.json    Place names and coordinates derived from GeoNames
              (https://www.geonames.org), Creative Commons Attribution 4.0,
              via the all-the-cities package.

  gaz/*.json  Finer gazetteer by country, built with tools/build-gaz.mjs from
              GeoNames country files and alternate names,
              Creative Commons Attribution 4.0.

Optional data under its own licence, read by the program but not part of it:

  hist/regions/*.json  Today's first-level subdivisions and dated historical
              regions derived from Natural Earth (public domain), built with
              tools/build-regions.mjs.

  hist/*.json Historical borders derived from historical-basemaps by
              Andre Ourednik (https://github.com/aourednik/historical-basemaps),
              GNU General Public License version 3. See hist/README.md.
              Leave the folder out if that licence does not suit your use.

